          "description": "This card is part 3 of the Little Explorers - London travel guide series. This card takes children on an immersive audio journey through the sounds of London. They will hear the hustle and bustle of the city's streets, the chimes of Big Ben, and much more. Through these sounds, children will gain a greater understanding of what it is like to live in and experience the city of London. ",
